`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`
Building a penguin in VOXI requires thinking in layers: feet at Y=0, body rising up, then head, with color contrast (black back, white belly) achieved by layering boxes. Spheres and ellipsoids help round out organic shapes.
`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`

